            {
                "entry_id": "4ce7ac1b-f086-3411-b8d6-aba23ecd0bde",
                "word": "minecraft",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "50db4ffb-eeb7-4c9f-88f5-ca76be67205e",
                        "entry_id": "4ce7ac1b-f086-3411-b8d6-aba23ecd0bde",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "minecraft"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "8a7c9b25-37ef-4646-a3ba-50fc1eb068fe",
                        "entry_id": "4ce7ac1b-f086-3411-b8d6-aba23ecd0bde",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "minecrafts"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b5e65930-b8a0-396a-8c35-55c7b13b0851",
                        "entry_id": "4ce7ac1b-f086-3411-b8d6-aba23ecd0bde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A warship which lays naval mines."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9faed3a-6221-4c32-a3bc-e3c6e071b3c0",
                                "sense_id": "b5e65930-b8a0-396a-8c35-55c7b13b0851",
                                "text": "Each was marked by lighted dan buoys spaced at one-mile intervals, laid by Fairmile motor launches of the Royal Navy, which followed immediately behind the minecraft."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bfaaa24-1445-4bc5-9b0a-332d641dfd39",
                                "sense_id": "b5e65930-b8a0-396a-8c35-55c7b13b0851",
                                "text": "By the end of May 8 the Japanese had lost one light carrier, a destroyer and several minecrafts. One large carrier had to be retired from the battle and sent home for repairs. The U.S. losses included one destroyer and an oiler, ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "547025bb-6eb3-4535-a0e8-8a225009b1c1",
                                "sense_id": "b5e65930-b8a0-396a-8c35-55c7b13b0851",
                                "text": "In reality, the ship was named (on 3 July 1990) along with several other MCMs to \"commemorate the service of World War II minecraft that saw significant service.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04a19e98-ea84-4f49-99f2-8647c61097f5",
                                "sense_id": "b5e65930-b8a0-396a-8c35-55c7b13b0851",
                                "text": "I had finally joined \"the big boys\" on a ship other than one called a craft . . . landing crafts or minecrafts. Now, after serving only 71 days, I was being booted off my first warship."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
